der  against yi for harassment and disturbing  her peace but what about pete davidson  can he get a restraining order and is  rap music a criminal threat now if you  told me last year that i was going to  analyze rap music using claymation to  simulate murder whether that could  constitute a crime  honestly i probably wouldn't have  questioned it given how strange the last  few years have been but let's dive into  this thing and as i mentioned in yay's  song easy  one of the lyrics threatens to quote  beat pete davidson's ass and in the  first easy music video uh he beheads and  then buries a claymation pete davidson  and in the next video yay has an  animated davidson beaten up by a monkey  now in response to criticism yay wrote  on an instagram post that art is therapy  and denied that he was making threats  quote art is not a proxy for ill or harm  any suggestion otherwise about my art is  false and mal intended so did yay commit  a crime in his music videos by  threatening to beat up davidson while  attacking animated representations of  davidson and does pete davidson have any  grounds for civil harassment restraining  order against yay well davidson's public  statements that he's not afraid of yay  is probably not going to help his case  for threatening this as criminal conduct  furthermore the leaked text messages  between yay and davidson purport to show  davidson eager to meet yay in public to  talk things out which undermines a claim  that davidson feels stalked or harassed  or suffering from actionable sustained  fear and furthermore the first amendment  gives a lot of leeway to artists and  gives a broad right to depict  exaggerated violence against public  figures so long as they don't directly  declare their intention to actually hurt  another person or encourage others to do  so like when kathy griffin  controversially held a mock severed head  of then president trump it might have  been in poor taste  and knocked her from the coveted c-list  to d-list  but it probably broke no laws given  yay's denial that he intended to  threaten davidson and davidson's lack of  fear yay's musical mutilation is likely  not a crime now that being said there  could be some really severe consequences  for kanye at least concerning his  visitation rights and custody of his  children for restrained persons a  restraining order can have very serious  consequences particularly in the context  of domestic violence and if kardashian  successfully wins a domestic violence  restraining order against yay he could  lose custody of his young children and  even lose the right to be in their lives  entirely california law has special  rules for custody and visitation rights  when it comes to domestic violence and a  judge will treat your case as a domestic  violence matter if one a parent has been  convicted of domestic violence against  the other parent in the last five years  or two any court has decided that one  parent committed domestic violence  against another parent or the children  and in fact under california law a judge  cannot award custody joint or otherwise  to the parent who committed domestic  violence unless that abusive parent  meets the burden to show among other  things that custody is in the best  interest of the children the abusive  parent committed a 52-week batterer  intervention program and has completed  any court-ordered substance abuse  counseling or parenting class has  complied with any restraining orders and  has not committed any further domestic  violence if kardashian obtains a  domestic violence restraining order it's  possible though not incredibly likely  that yay could lose all right to custody  be subject to supervised visitation or  even be ordered to stay at least 100  yards away from his ex and their young  children yay can be ordered to stop  communicating with kardashian and  davidson both directly and indirectly  via social media and in fact the family  law judge handling divorce could order  yay to stop discussing the divorce his  kids and his ex-wife's new boyfriend  with the public if kardashian proves  that she feels threatened or harmed by  this conduct  you know throughout this entire ordeal  yay has maintained that he's always been  acting in the best interest of his  children but if yay doesn't get his act  together and stop with this bizarre and  potentially menacing behavior he risks  losing his family forever now with  situations like these it's always  important to avoid emotion and think  logically which you can learn to do with  today's sponsor brilliant brilliant is  an online learning platform for stem  that replaces lecture videos with  hands-on interactive lessons it's for  curious learners both young and old  professional and inexperienced so if  you'd like to exercise your brain or  help your kids with school brilliant has  you more than covered now one of my  favorite courses is all about logic  brilliance logic courses cover liar and  truth-teller riddles logical fallacies  machine logic and even some strategic  game theory and logic is a crucial skill  that lawyers need every day and  brilliant lets you learn by doing rather  than listening to hours of boring  lectures learning through doing is  scientifically proven to be the most  effective way to master any skill and  the courses have storytelling  interactive challenges and problems to  solve you will absolutely love it and  within brilliance library you'll find  courses like calculus linear algebra  math and that applies to trading and  finance basically every scientific and  mathematical thing that you would want  to learn you'll also find courses on  gravitational physics astronomy and  machine learning now you can sign up and  start learning for free today with the  link that's on screen right now which  will take you to brilliant.org  legaleagle and the first 200 people to  sign up will also get 20 off their  annual subscription so just click on the  link that's on screen righ